 independent across the 3 tags, I can batch them.\n\nActually, I need to create the points first before enabling history. But the 3 point creations are independent of each other, so I can do them all in one batch. Then enable history for all 3 in another batch.\n\nLet me create all 3 points first, with appropriate units:\n- TI-201: Temperature, unit could be °C\n- PI-201: Pressure, unit could be kPa or bar\n- FI-201: Flow, unit could be m³/h or L/min\n\nI'll create all 3 points in one call, then enable history for all 3."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10115, "output_tokens": 109, "latency_ms": 4167.266100004781, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "3 个点创建成功，现在为它们开启历史记录：", "reasoning": "All 3 points created successfully. Now let me enable history for all 3."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10333, "output_tokens": 190, "latency_ms": 5532.5616000336595, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ 全部完成！已创建 3 个 AI 点并开启历史记录：\n\n| Tag | 类型 | 单位 | 描述 | 历史 |\n|-----|------|------|------|------|\n| **TI-201** | analog | °C | 温度指示 201 | ✅ 已启用 |\n| **PI-201** | analog | kPa | 压力指示 201 | ✅ 已启用 |\n| **FI-201** | analog | m³/h | 流量指示 201 | ✅ 已启用 |\n\n历史记录默认参数：周期采样 1s，保留 30 天。如需调整采样间隔、死区或保留天数，请告诉我。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All done. Let me summarize for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 30006, "output_tokens": 762, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21892.24660000764}, "judge": null}
