igh |\n| `alarm_TI201_LL` | 低低限 (LL) | 10 | 🔴 high |\n\n报警逻辑：\n- 当 TI-201 值 ≥ **100** 时，触发 HH 报警\n- 当 TI-201 值 ≤ **10** 时，触发 LL 报警\n\n如需设置死区（deadband）或调整阈值，请告诉我！", "reasoning": "Both alarms were created successfully. Let me summarize the results for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19530, "output_tokens": 530, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14882.170500000939}, "judge": null}
