 other)\n2. Then enable history for all 3 (independent of each other, but dependent on step 1)\n\nLet me create the three points first. I'll use reasonable conventions:\n- TI-201: Temperature, analog, unit °C\n- PI-201: Pressure, analog, unit could be bar or kPa or psi\n- FI-201: Flow, analog, unit could be m³/h or L/min\n\nThe user said \"全是AI\" meaning all are analog input. I'll create them as analog type. For units, I'll use common industrial units. Actually, the user didn't specify units, so I could leave them without units or add common ones. Let me add typical units to be helpful.\n\nActually, let me just create the points first without specifying units since the user didn't specify, and the unit parameter is optional. I'll keep it simple."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10154, "output_tokens": 120, "latency_ms": 8317.752499948256, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "三个点位创建成功，接下来开启历史记录：", "reasoning": "All three points created successfully. Now I need to enable history for all three. These are independent of each other so I can do them in one call."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19712, "output_tokens": 622, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 23313.014600018505}, "judge": null}
