int"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0097999582067132, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9542, "output_tokens": 158, "latency_ms": 6043.743600021116, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来帮你创建一个趋势页面并添加趋势图表。首先让我了解一下当前项目中已有的页面和历史数据点情况。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create a trend page\n2. Add a trend chart widget\n3. Bind it to historical data\n\nLet me start by analyzing what's needed. First, I should check if there are existing points with history enabled, since we need to bind historical data to the trend chart.\n\nLet me first list the existing pages and points with history to understand the current state of the project."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9798, "output_tokens": 341, "latency_ms": 11790.756800037343, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目是空的，还没有任何数据点或历史记录配置。要创建趋势图表并绑定历史数据，我们需要先做一些准备工作。\n\n我有几个问题需要确认：\n\n1. **数据点**：你希望趋势图监控什么数据？比如温度、压力、流量等模拟量？请告诉我：\n   - 点位名称（tag），例如 `TEMP_101`\n   - 工程单位，例如 `°C`、`bar`\n   - 量程范围（最小值和最大值）\n\n2. **趋势图需求**：\n   - 需要在一个趋势图上显示几个点位？\n   - 历史数据的采样模式偏好：**周期采样**（periodic）还是**变化时记录**（on_change）？\n\n如果你只是想先建一个示例演示，我可以用默认的示例点位（如温度 TEMP_101、压力 PRESS_201）快速搭建，你确认一下？", "reasoning": "The project is empty - no pages, no points, no history configurations. To create a trend chart with historical data, we need:\n1. At least one point (tag) with history enabled\n2. A page to place the trend chart\n3. The trend chart widget\n4. Bind the point to the trend chart\n\nSince there are no points or history configured, I need to either:\n- Ask the user what data they want to track, or\n- Create some sample points with history\n\nLet me ask the user what kind of data they want to monitor in the trend chart. They might want temperature, pressure, flow rate, etc."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19340, "output_tokens": 499, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17871.312500035856}, "judge": null}
