}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "deploy_project", "action": "deploy_project", "args": {"deployment_id": "default"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "status": "deployed"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default.status": "deployed"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.0391000066883862, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:52c7913229f6930a3bed94ef795881dfac3d9f150188eafd108d0579ba59655c", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9564, "output_tokens": 552, "latency_ms": 11815.1623000158, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来为您构建一个完整的反应釜综合监控方案。按照以下步骤进行：\n\n1. **新建画面** - 反应釜监控页面\n2. **创建三个点位** - 温度、压力、液位\n3. **绑定到画面控件** - 罐子和仪表\n4. **校验并下发**\n\n---\n\n### 第一步：新建画面 + 创建三个点位（并行操作）", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a comprehensive reactor monitoring solution. Let me break down what they need:\n\n1. Create a new HMI page (画面)\n2. Create 3 points (tags): temperature, pressure, and level\n3. Bind these points to widgets on the page (tank and instruments)\n4. Validate and deploy\n\nLet me start by creating the page and the three points simultaneously, since they are independent operations.\n\nFor the points:\n- Temperature: analog, unit °C, typical range 0-200\n- Pressure: analog, unit MPa, typical range 0-2.5\n- Level: analog, unit %, typical range 0-100\n\nFor the page, I'll create a reactor monitoring page.\n\nLet me start with creating the page and points in parallel."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10247, "output_tokens": 1007, "latency_ms": 23410.647000011522, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 画面和三个点位创建成功！\n\n---\n\n### 第二步：在画面上放置控件（罐子、温度计、压力表）", "reasoning": "All created successfully. Now I need to add widgets to the page:\n1. A tank widget for level display\n2. A thermometer for temperature\n3. A gauge/manometer for pressure\n4. Add some labels and decorative elements\n\nLet me create the widgets. I'll create:\n- Tank widget (for level)\n- Thermometer widget (for temperature)\n- Pressure gauge (I'll use a generic widget type, maybe \"gauge\" or similar)\n\nLooking at the available widget types mentioned: 'thermometer' / 'tank' / 'pump' / 'rect'. I don't see a pressure gauge explicitly, but I'll try common types. Let me use what's available.\n\nI'll create:\n1. Tank widget for level\n2. Thermometer for temperature  \n3. For pressure, I'll use a rect or try 'gauge' as a type\n\nLet me also add labels for each."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 11534, "output_tokens": 239, "latency_ms": 7752.039099985268, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 控件和标签全部放置成功！\n\n---\n\n### 第三步：绑定点位到控件", "reasoning": "All widgets and labels created. Now I need to bind the points to the widgets."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 11897, "output_tokens": 60, "latency_ms": 3165.4678999911994, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 点位绑定完成！\n\n---\n\n### 第四步：校验并下发", "reasoning": "All bindings are successful. Now I need to validate the project and then deploy."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 12000, "output_tokens": 52, "latency_ms": 4650.3325999947265, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ 项目校验通过，无错误！现在执行下发：", "reasoning": "Validation passed with no errors. Now I can deploy the project."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 12092, "output_tokens": 341, "latency_ms": 8655.120599956717, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "---\n\n## ✅ 反应釜综合监控方案 — 配置完成！\n\n整个方案已成功部署，以下是配置清单：\n\n| 类别 | 名称 | 详情 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **📄 画面** | `page_reactor_01` | 反应釜综合监控（1920×1080，深色背景） |\n| **📊 点位** | `REACTOR_TEMP_01` | 温度 · 0~200 °C |\n| | `REACTOR_PRESS_01` | 压力 · 0~2.5 MPa |\n| | `REACTOR_LEVEL_01` | 液位 · 0~100 % |\n| **🎛️ 控件** | `tank_level_01` | 罐子 ← 液位 |\n| | `thermometer_temp_01` | 温度计 ← 温度 |\n| | `gauge_press_01` | 压力表 ← 压力 |\n| **📝 标签** | 标题 + 3个单位说明 | 中文标注 |\n| **📦 状态** | 🟢 **已部署** | 校验无错误，下发成功 |\n\n> 💡 **后续建议**：如需为温度/压力/液位添加报警限值（如高温报警、低液位报警等），可以告诉我，我会继续为您配置。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The project has been deployed successfully. Let me summarize everything for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 67334, "output_tokens": 2251, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 59590.46249999665}, "judge": null}
