on:\n- PUMP_01_STATUS (digital - running/stopped)\n- PUMP_01_CMD (digital - start/stop command)\n- PUMP_01_FLOW (analog - flow rate)\n- PUMP_01_PRESSURE (analog - discharge pressure)\n- PUMP_01_CURRENT (analog - motor current)\n\nThen create the HMI page and add widgets.\n\nLet me start by creating all the points and the page in parallel since they're independent."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9548, "output_tokens": 719, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16286.307499976829}, "judge": null}
