ployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "validate_project", "action": "validate_project", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.06120000034570694, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:388a34a7779137bb84df9a5f884fe7493d039a03adbefc84e90c37ac114527d4", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9548, "output_tokens": 920, "latency_ms": 26523.937599966303, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来帮你搭建一个完整的泵站控制台，包含点位、HMI页面、控件、报警和控制脚本。我们先创建基础点位和页面。\n\n**第一步：创建点位和HMI页面（无依赖，并行执行）**", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a pump station control console with start/stop control, and also set up alarms. Let me analyze what needs to be done:\n\n1. **Points (Tags)** - Need to create:\n   - Digital point for pump status (running/stopped)\n   - Digital point for pump start/stop command\n   - Analog points for things like pressure, flow, temperature\n   - Maybe a fault/alarm digital point\n\n2. **Alarms** - Need to create:\n   - High pressure alarm\n   - Low pressure alarm\n   - Maybe fault alarm\n   - Maybe high temperature alarm\n\n3. **HMI Page** - Need to create:\n   - A pump station page\n   - Pump widget with start/stop buttons\n   - Status indicators\n   - Gauges/displays for analog values\n\n4. **Scripts** - Possibly a script for pump control logic\n\nLet me start by creating the points first, then the page, then the widgets and alarms.\n\nI'll plan out a typical pump station:\n\n**Points:**\n- PUMP_CMD (digital) - Start/stop command\n- PUMP_STATUS (digital) - Running status\n- PUMP_FAULT (digital) - Fault status\n- PUMP_PRESSURE (analog) - Discharge pressure, 0-25 bar\n- PUMP_FLOW (analog) - Flow rate, 0-100 m³/h\n- PUMP_TEMP (analog) - Bearing temperature, 0-150 °C\n\n**Alarms:**\n- High pressure alarm (>18 bar)\n- Low pressure alarm (<2 bar) \n- High temperature alarm (>90°C)\n- Fault alarm (PUMP_FAULT = true)\n\nLet me create the points first, and the page in parallel since they don't depend on each other.\n\nActually, let me think about dependencies:\n- Points and pages can be created in parallel\n- Widgets depend on pages\n- Alarms depend on points\n- Bindings depend on both points and widgets\n\nSo I can create points and pages in parallel first.\n\nLet me start with creating all the points and the page."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10666, "output_tokens": 2137, "latency_ms": 40561.36330001755, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位和页面创建完成！现在创建HMI控件和报警：\n\n**第二步：创建控件和报警**", "reasoning": "All points and the page are created. Now I need to:\n1. Create widgets on the page (pump, gauges, buttons, indicators)\n2. Create alarms\n3. Create control script\n4. Bind points to widgets\n\nLet me create the widgets and alarms in parallel. I'll create:\n- A pump widget\n- Temperature gauge/thermometer\n- Pressure gauge\n- Flow meter\n- Start button (rect with text)\n- Stop button (rect with text)\n- Status indicator (circle)\n- Fault indicator (circle)\n- Various labels\n\nLet me create the widgets and alarms together since they're independent."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 13653, "output_tokens": 792, "latency_ms": 14571.348899975419, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "控件和报警全部创建成功！现在绑定点位到控件，并创建控制脚本：\n\n**第三步：绑定点位 + 创建控制脚本**", "reasoning": "All widgets, alarms, and pipe segments created successfully. Now I need to:\n1. Bind points to widgets (pump, gauges, LEDs)\n2. Create the pump control script\n\nLet me do all bindings and the script creation in parallel."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 14764, "output_tokens": 64, "latency_ms": 6018.6412000330165, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "全部绑定和脚本创建完成！最后做一次项目校验：\n\n**第四步：校验项目**", "reasoning": "Everything is set up. Let me now run validation to make sure everything is consistent, and then present a summary to the user."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 14871, "output_tokens": 575, "latency_ms": 13767.325900029391, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "项目校验通过，零错误！✅\n\n---\n\n## 🏭 泵站控制台 — 全套配置完成\n\n### 📌 点位列表 (6个)\n\n| 标签 | 类型 | 说明 | 工程单位 | 量程 |\n|------|------|------|----------|------|\n| `PUMP_CMD` | 数字 | 启停命令 | — | 0/1 |\n| `PUMP_STATUS` | 数字 | 运行状态反馈 | — | 0/1 |\n| `PUMP_FAULT` | 数字 | 故障信号 | — | 0/1 |\n| `PUMP_PRESSURE` | 模拟 | 出口压力 | bar | 0~25 |\n| `PUMP_FLOW` | 模拟 | 出口流量 | m³/h | 0~100 |\n| `PUMP_TEMP` | 模拟 | 轴承温度 | °C | 0~150 |\n\n### 🖥️ HMI页面 `泵站控制台`\n\n- **深色工业风背景** (#1a2332)\n- 🔵 **进水管线** → 🟢 **储罐** → **泵** → 🟡 **仪表区**\n- 3个仪表：出口压力 / 轴承温度 / 流量（带颜色区分）\n- 绿色 **▶ 启动** / 红色 **■ 停止** 按钮\n- 🟢 运行状态指示灯 / 🔴 故障指示灯\n\n### 🚨 报警配置 (4条)\n\n| 报警ID | 关联点位 | 触发条件 | 优先级 |\n|--------|----------|----------|--------|\n| `alarm_high_pressure` | PUMP_PRESSURE | > 18 bar | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_low_pressure` | PUMP_PRESSURE | < 2 bar | 🟡中 |\n| `alarm_high_temp` | PUMP_TEMP | > 90 °C | 🔴高 |\n| `alarm_pump_fault` | PUMP_FAULT | 变为true | 🔴高 |\n\n### ⚙️ 控制脚本\n\n- **泵启停联锁逻辑**：当泵有故障时自动拒绝启动命令，防止带故障开机\n\n### 📊 历史归档\n\n- 压力、温度、流量均已开启历史记录，**5秒采样**，保留 **90天**\n\n---\n\n如需下装部署，可以随时告诉我！", "reasoning": "The project is validated with no errors. Let me present a summary to the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 63502, "output_tokens": 4488, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 101590.20819998113}, "judge": null}
