表示泵的运行状态）\n- 泵启停控制点（数字类型，用于控制泵的启停）\n- 可能还需要一些模拟量点位（如压力、流量等），但用户没有明确要求，可以先创建基础的点位。\n\n让我创建点位。首先创建泵状态点："}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10068, "output_tokens": 58, "latency_ms": 4377.096200012602, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "创建泵启停控制点："}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10163, "output_tokens": 55, "latency_ms": 2242.709299956914, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "创建泵故障报警点："}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10255, "output_tokens": 83, "latency_ms": 4191.040400008205, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在创建HMI页面。我需要创建一个泵站控制台页面。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10374, "output_tokens": 142, "latency_ms": 4733.965199964587, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在在页面上添加控件。首先添加一个泵状态显示控件（使用tank或pump类型）。让我先查看一下create_widget支持哪些控件类型。从描述看支持thermometer、tank、pump等。我选择pump类型。\n\n首先添加泵控件："}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10554, "output_tokens": 135, "latency_ms": 4454.688300029375, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "添加启停按钮。由于没有专门的按钮控件，我可以使用矩形和文本组合来模拟按钮。先创建一个矩形作为按钮背景："}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10739, "output_tokens": 92, "latency_ms": 5175.245799997356, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "在按钮上添加文字："}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10882, "output_tokens": 108, "latency_ms": 6854.4666999951005, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "添加停止按钮："}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 11040, "output_tokens": 91, "latency_ms": 4582.409899972845, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "添加停止按钮文字："}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 11182, "output_tokens": 84, "latency_ms": 6153.571099974215, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在需要将点位绑定到控件。首先将泵状态点绑定到泵控件："}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 124358, "output_tokens": 1257, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 61386.643400008325}, "judge": null}
