und (800, 30) or so\n- Pump 1: left side, around (400, 400)\n- Pump 2: right side, around (1200, 400)\n\nI'll create all three widgets now since they don't depend on each other."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10330, "output_tokens": 219, "latency_ms": 5920.811899995897, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "再为两台泵添加标签说明：", "reasoning": "All widgets created successfully. Let me add some text labels for the two pumps to make it clearer."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10648, "output_tokens": 330, "latency_ms": 6874.100799963344, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **污水泵站总览画面已创建完成！**\n\n页面布局如下：\n\n| 组件 | Widget ID | 位置 | 说明 |\n|------|-----------|------|------|\n| 📺 页面 | `pump_station_overview` | 1920×1080 | 黑色背景 |\n| 📝 标题 | `title_main` | 顶部居中 | \"污水泵站总览\" 白色粗体 36号字 |\n| 🔵 1#泵 | `pump_01` | 左侧 (350, 300) | 300×300 泵组件 |\n| 🔵 2#泵 | `pump_02` | 右侧 (1100, 300) | 300×300 泵组件 |\n| 🏷️ 标签 | `pump_01_label` | 泵下方 | \"1# 泵\" 绿色 |\n| 🏷️ 标签 | `pump_02_label` | 泵下方 | \"2# 泵\" 绿色 |\n\n后续可以：\n- 将泵组件**绑定实际点位**（如 `bind_point`）\n- 添加**管道连接线**（`create_line`）\n- 添加**阀门、液位计**等其他设备\n- 配置**报警和历史记录**\n\n需要继续完善画面吗？", "reasoning": "All done. Let me summarize what was created."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 40361, "output_tokens": 1174, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 34993.93019999843}, "judge": null}
