"list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "reactor_template", "name": "反应釜模板"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.02570002106949687, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:c2a4397e34f829d22244f534ffd63ae13200839d3dc0aebeae2f0c044d04af5b", "final_hash": "sha256:c2a4397e34f829d22244f534ffd63ae13200839d3dc0aebeae2f0c044d04af5b", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9552, "output_tokens": 92, "latency_ms": 7407.840800005943, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先查看当前项目中已有的页面，找到反应釜模板画面。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Copy a reactor template page to create a new page called \"reactor_12\"\n2. Change the title to \"12号反应釜\"\n3. Keep the tank bindings\n\nLet me first check what pages exist in the project to find the reactor template."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9697, "output_tokens": 518, "latency_ms": 11635.97290002508, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "找到了反应釜模板页面（ID: `reactor_template`，名称：反应釜模板）。\n\n但很遗憾，当前可用的工具中 **没有\"复制/克隆页面\"的功能**。现有工具只能：\n- 创建新空白页面\n- 手动逐个创建控件并绑定点位\n\n**无法直接复制页面及其所有控件和绑定关系。**\n\n---\n\n### 我可以为您提供以下替代方案：\n\n**方案 A — 手动重建（需要您提供模板布局信息）**\n1. 创建新页面 `reactor_12`\n2. 根据模板上的控件逐一创建（需要知道控件类型、位置、绑定的 tag 等）\n\n**方案 B — 使用平台内置功能**\n- 在 SCADA 平台的页面管理界面中，通常有\"复制页面\"或\"另存为\"功能，可以直接复制模板并改名，所有控件和绑定会自动保留。\n\n---\n\n如果您选择**方案 A**，请提供以下信息：\n1. 模板页面上有哪些控件（如 thermometer、tank、pump 等）？\n2. 每个控件绑定了哪些点位（tag）？\n3. 控件的大致位置和尺寸？\n\n您希望采用哪种方案？", "reasoning": "I found the reactor template page with id \"reactor_template\". Now I need to create a new page \"reactor_12\" based on this template. However, looking at the available tools, I don't see a \"copy_page\" or \"duplicate_page\" function. \n\nLet me think about what tools are available:\n- create_page: Create a new HMI page\n- rename_page: Change display name\n- delete_page: Delete a page\n- create_widget: Place widgets\n- bind_point: Bind points to widgets\n- list_pages: List pages\n\nThere's no copy/duplicate page functionality available. I should inform the user that I cannot directly copy a page, but I can:\n1. Create a new page \"reactor_12\"\n2. Then I would need to know what widgets are on the template to recreate them\n\nActually, I don't have a tool to list widgets on a page either. Let me be honest with the user that the current toolset doesn't support page duplication.\n\nI should explain this limitation and offer alternatives - either I can create a new page from scratch if they tell me the layout, or suggest they use the platform's built-in duplication feature if available."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19249, "output_tokens": 610, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19080.397099955007}, "judge": null}
