ge \"pump_panel\" exists by listing the pages. I also need to check if the points PUMP_A_RUN and PUMP_A_HZ exist.\n\nLet me start by listing the pages and points to verify they exist."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9863, "output_tokens": 341, "latency_ms": 9662.848600011785, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面 `pump_panel`（泵面板）和两个点位 `PUMP_A_RUN`（数字量）和 `PUMP_A_HZ`（模拟量，单位Hz）都已存在。现在我来添加泵图元并绑定点位。", "reasoning": "Great! The page \"pump_panel\" exists (name: \"泵面板\"), and both points exist:\n- PUMP_A_RUN (digital type)\n- PUMP_A_HZ (analog type, unit: Hz)\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Create a pump widget on the pump_panel page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the pump's running status (likely a \"value\" or \"status\" property)\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the pump's frequency (likely a \"frequency\" property)\n\nLet me create the pump widget first. I'll need to choose a position and size. Let me place it at a reasonable position, say [400, 300] with a size of [120, 120] for a pump widget.\n\nFor the bindings, typical pump widget properties might be:\n- \"value\" or \"status\" for running status\n- \"frequency\" for frequency\n\nI'll create the widget first, then bind the points to it."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10239, "output_tokens": 191, "latency_ms": 4672.529300034512, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵图元已创建成功，现在进行点位绑定：", "reasoning": "Good, the pump widget was created. Now I need to bind the two points to the widget properties:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN -> pump_a's \"value\" or \"status\" property (for running status)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ -> pump_a's \"frequency\" property\n\nLet me bind both points."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 29656, "output_tokens": 687, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 21329.279300000053}, "judge": null}
