e \"chem_panel\" page and bind three SCADA points to it:\n- LT_01 for level (液位)\n- TT_01 for temperature (温度)\n- PT_01 for pressure (压力)\n\nFirst, I need to check if the page \"chem_panel\" exists. Let me list the pages first to find its ID."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9720, "output_tokens": 233, "latency_ms": 6398.353800002951, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "页面存在，ID 为 `chem_panel`。现在我来在该页面上创建一个罐体，并绑定液位、温度和压力三个点位。", "reasoning": "The page \"chem_panel\" exists with name \"化工面板\". Now I need to create a tank widget on this page. I'll need to specify:\n- page_id: \"chem_panel\"\n- widget_id: a unique ID for the tank widget\n- type: \"tank\"\n- position: I'll place it at a reasonable position, e.g. [400, 200]\n- size: a reasonable size for a tank, e.g. [200, 300]\n\nLet me create the tank widget first, then bind the three points to it."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9989, "output_tokens": 253, "latency_ms": 6022.419499990065, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体创建成功！现在绑定三个点位：", "reasoning": "The tank widget was created successfully. Now I need to bind the three points to it:\n- LT_01 for level\n- TT_01 for temperature\n- PT_01 for pressure\n\nI'll bind them to the appropriate properties of the tank widget. Common properties would be \"level\", \"temperature\", \"pressure\"."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10352, "output_tokens": 202, "latency_ms": 5549.557999998797, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 在 `chem_panel`（化工面板）页面上成功创建了罐体并完成点位绑定：\n\n| 属性 | 绑定点位 | 说明 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `level` | **LT_01** | 液位 |\n| `temperature` | **TT_01** | 温度 |\n| `pressure` | **PT_01** | 压力 |\n\n**罐体信息：**\n- Widget ID：`tank_01`\n- 位置：(400, 200)\n- 尺寸：200 × 300\n\n罐体现在会实时显示 LT_01 的液位、TT_01 的温度和 PT_01 的压力数据。如果需要调整位置、大小或添加报警配置，请告诉我！", "reasoning": "All three bindings were created successfully. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 39619, "output_tokens": 799, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 22160.11219995562}, "judge": null}
